# title: Reverse convertible
# category: Structured notes
# underlyings: 1
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: A one-year note paying a 10% coupon; the capital comes back in full only if the stock ends at or above its initial level, otherwise in proportion to its fall.
#
# Notional 1000. The investor is short an at-the-money put: that premium
# pays for the coupon.

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot()

2028-01-04
    pays 1000 * 0.10
    if spot() >= s0 then pays 1000 else pays 1000 * spot() / s0 endIf
